    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d934">

                <pb facs="0918" n="834" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg834"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 635.119/470</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">F. J. Stimson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-05-18T10:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 18, 1918, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 11.50 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your May 3, 4 p.m. I delivered the substance of these instructions to Naón and
                    last night the Minister of Marine informally <pb facs="0919" n="835"
                        xml:id="pg835"/> told me that the Argentine Government would consider the
                    explanation entirely satisfactory and the incident closed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
